Title: Even Better
Credit: example micro-story for ai-movie
Draft: 2 (after script doctor)

EXT. APARTMENT BALCONY AND STREET - BLUE HOUR

[[beat b1 (ki): a quiet evening; this small person is waiting]]

From the street: a lit third-floor window. In front of it, a small figure on tiptoe at the balcony rail, chin just over the top. The streetlight on the corner flickers on.

NARRATOR (V.O.)
Six o'clock. Mia keeps watch.

[[beat b2 (sho): we know what she wants]]

Close, through the balusters. MIA (6) leans to one side, peering down the street towards the corner, both hands on the rail.

NARRATOR (V.O.)
She knows the sound of Dad's car.

[[beat b3 (ten): hope, held in silence]]

Looking down from the balcony: headlights swing round the corner under the streetlight. Mia rises higher on her toes.

[[beat b4 (ten): not Dad]]

The headlight belongs to a delivery scooter, a pizza box strapped on the back, pulling up to her building.

NARRATOR (V.O.)
Not Dad.

[[beat b5 (ketsu): delight]]

Mia throws both arms high above the rail, up on her toes, the warm window glowing behind her.

NARRATOR (V.O.)
Even better.

FADE OUT.
